    <briefdescription>
<para>Collection of named constants per fixup kind. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Mandatory entries: Opcode - Values of the op-code bits in the instruction, with unaffected bits nulled OpcodeMask - Mask with all bits set that encode the op-code</para>
<para>Other common entries: ImmMask - Mask with all bits set that encode the immediate value RegMask - Mask with all bits set that encode the register</para>
<para>Specializations can add further custom fields without restrictions. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
